at $x$ can take any value less than $-5,$ or greater than $-3.$\n\nTo represent this on a number line, we graph the two separate inequalities:\n\n- the inequality $x<-5$ consists of an open circle at $-5$ and an arrow to the left.\n\n- the inequality $x>-3$ consists of a open circle at $-3$ and an arrow to the right.\n\nThe resulting graph is as follows:\n\n![](images/21/21bf7706ef220b10f065a8f21c73ea8802740e89f2a5fa5742555f53420899d3.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5a82667b-e676-5e9f-90a4-24e7e92a3870"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5a82667b-e676-5e9f-90a4-24e7e92a3870" :answer-field/id #uuid "5a82667b-e676-5e9f-90a4-24e7e92a3870" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ae960d4b-5d26-51bb-be57-a0dc59a54274" :answer-field/choices ["answer-76515e05-7c74-5bc3-96d2-511a762926bf" "answer-ae960d4b-5d26-51bb-be57-a0dc59a54274" "answer-e638c9dd-cea9-594c-a431-b31ecf02da5d" "answer-37eb8d44-7159-5664-9d24-99f8dff170c5" "answer-b9beacb9-dc2e-5fbf-b14c-1f02260d95a3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-76515e05-7c74-5bc3-96d2-511a762926bf" :answer/id #uuid "76515e05-7c74-5bc3-96d2-511a762926bf" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/21/214add3358f9ca8a35d951b099a95e4d8ffc90190ad21b1fbf3d5d77ec8e6535.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae960d4b-5d26-51bb-be57-a0dc59a54274" :answer/id #uuid "ae960d4b-5d26-51bb-be57-a0dc59a54274" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/21/21bf7706ef220b10f065a8f21c73ea8802740e89f2a5fa5742555f53420899d3.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e638c9dd-cea9-594c-a431-b31ecf02da5d" :answer/id #uuid "e638c9dd-cea9-594c-a431-b31ecf02da5d" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/9a/9a8436810690cf8687fccc35d586b1d51e0d1ccc608ddd86e572edc61c32fce8.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-37eb8d44-7159-5664-9d2