ng the rules of absolute value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{(7hk)^{2}} & =|7hk| \\\\  & =|7|\\cdot |hk| \\\\  & =7|hk|\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7b969c33-fde1-5cdb-94d7-ebf310e61844"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7b969c33-fde1-5cdb-94d7-ebf310e61844" :answer-field/id #uuid "7b969c33-fde1-5cdb-94d7-ebf310e61844" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d878ba9d-e27a-5610-a312-39fe41c2686c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a3e1d779-fc09-5b5c-b902-bb741b10459b" "answer-61381c90-de08-5a13-a098-eb1c4e1bf2de" "answer-d878ba9d-e27a-5610-a312-39fe41c2686c" "answer-c611a85e-5714-52e9-b3f1-8a6f851d8b55" "answer-722cfa04-487a-530b-acba-80c4f56e5c8d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a3e1d779-fc09-5b5c-b902-bb741b10459b" :answer/id #uuid "a3e1d779-fc09-5b5c-b902-bb741b10459b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7hk" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-61381c90-de08-5a13-a098-eb1c4e1bf2de" :answer/id #uuid "61381c90-de08-5a13-a098-eb1c4e1bf2de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7{h}^{2}{k}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d878ba9d-e27a-5610-a312-39fe41c2686c" :answer/id #uuid "d878ba9d-e27a-5610-a312-39fe41c2686c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7|hk|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c611a85e-5714-52e9-b3f1-8a6f851d8b55" :answer/id #uuid "c611a85e-5714-52e9-b3f1-8a6f851d8b55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pm 7hk" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-722cfa04-487a-530b-acba-80c4f56e5c8d" :answer/id #uuid "722cfa04-487a-530b-acba-80c4f56e5c8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{7hk}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1ea1bc4b-df65-5c2e-8a1e-25b530d6cd97" :question/id #uuid "1ea1bc4b-df65-5c2e-8a1e-25b530d6cd97" :question/math-academy-id "q-129465" :question/problem "$\\sqrt{\\frac{{r}^{2}}{100}}=$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the square root of a perfect square can be simplified using absolute value.\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{{x}^{2}}=|x|\n$$\n\nAlso, we notice that ${r}^{2}$ and $100$ are both perfect squares.\n\nFirst, we write the expression under the square root as a perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\frac{{r}^{2}}{100}} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{r}^{2}}{{10}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{r\\cdot r}{10\\cdot 10}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{r}{10}\\cdot \\frac{r}{10}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{r}{10})}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the absolute value of the squared quantity and simplify using the rules of absolute value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{(\\frac{r}{10})}^{2}} & =|\\frac{r}{10}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|r|}{|10|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|r|}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-903290b8-9d04-50ab-9ab9-3b30be15c773"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-903290b8-9d04-50ab-9ab9-3b30be15c773" :answer-field/id #uuid "903290b8-9d04-50ab-9ab9-3b30be15c773" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-40b07501-069c-515d-b0e4-25b6aea2080b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e281c12c-09da-5127-85cb-7d8cc84bf743" "answer-17341934-1f7c-517d-8c9b-00c031b8823a" "answer-7ab85dd4-a67f-5d96-9874-b5311a0fcf49" "answer-40b07501-069c-515d-b0e4-25b6aea2080b" "answer-684728cb-9a8a-5e94-9dd1-04eb633a68d5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e281c12c-09da-5127-85cb-7d8cc84bf743" :answer/id #uuid "e281c12c-09da-5127-85cb-7d8cc84bf743" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{r}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17341934-1f7c-517d-8c9b-00c031b8823a" :answer/id #uuid "17341934-1f7c-517d-8c9b-00c031b8823a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{r}^{2}}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7ab85dd4-a67f-5d96-